  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the Notifications view, there needs to be a filtering to sort between Group Announcements, and Group Join Requests, etc. I find it's becoming troublesome just blazing through hundreds of Notifications, trying to clear them out so I can go through the list of applicants, which in itself is a task.  Simple imho, either replace the Group Notifications with two new buttons or add two new buttons below \"Group Notifications\" for the \"Alerts/Announcements\" and \"Join Requests.\" There's simply too much going on now with Groups to wrap it all up into one category of Notifications.",
